ception."}, {"id": "development_grounded_anime_hair", "label": "Grounded Anime-Inspired Hair Rule", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "DEVELOPMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hair stays anime-inspired but grounded: pointed bangs, sidelocks, braids and buns, but no gravity-defying Goku/Vegeta spikes."}, {"id": "development_locked_outfits", "label": "Locked One-Piece Outfits (locked_to)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DEVELOPMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tops and bottoms mix freely within a set except where tags forbid it (armor, hose, kilt, sandals) or a top and bottom are locked_to each other, e.g. gowns, habits, jester's motley."}, {"id": "development_shared_gait_function", "label": "Shared Gait Function (resident and armor models)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DEVELOPMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Resident and armor models share one gait function so armor follows the stride; special vanilla poses and original face UV colors must stay intact."}, {"id": "development_name_pools", "label": "Editable Name Pools (tools/name_pools.json)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DEVELOPMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Names stay editable but complexion eligibility must be preserved (e.g. Indian names for brown/dark complexions)."}, {"id": "development_focused_gametest_flags", "label": "Focused Client GameTest Flags", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "DEVELOPMENT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "runClientGameTest flags (-PfoundationOnly, -PstructuresOnly, -PguardsOnly, -Pcompan